(Copyright (c) 2025 Tim Henkes (Syndace)) to the Espressif ESP-IDF. The
original libxeddsa source files under `src/` and `include/` remain the
copyright of Tim Henkes (Syndace) and are reproduced here under the MIT
License with the original copyright notice preserved, as MIT requires.

The ESP-IDF build-integration and porting work (the top-level and `ref10/`
CMake build system, the trimmed `ref10/crypto_sign` file set, the
`ESP_PLATFORM` handling in `ref10/include/cross_platform.h`, and the
documentation) is Copyright (c) 2025 Antonino Mastronardo, and is likewise
licensed under the MIT License.

The `ref10/crypto_sign/` elliptic-curve arithmetic is derived from Daniel J.
Bernstein's public-domain ref10 implementation of Curve25519/Ed25519; those
files are in the public domain and are redistributed without copyright
claim.

